    <data key="d0">Global DataNet - Construction Site Image Obfuscation Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aY-wF9g0qkM</data>
    <data key="d2">Serverless multi-tenant architecture ingesting ~86,000 images per day worldwide, achieving a 47% cost reduction compared to on-premise solutions.</data>
